  <p class="page-kicker">Head to head</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">KROSER Laptop Briefcase vs Tomtoc 360 Slim Sleeve</h1>
  <p class="page-lead">Both protect a laptop. They solve totally different problems. The briefcase is a full carry bag with room for charger, notebook, headphones. The slim sleeve is padding-only and goes inside a backpack you already own. Buy the wrong one and you'll wonder why nobody uses it.</p>

